{title: 550 - Every Flower That Grows}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #550 • LAUREL • 12.9.9.9}
{lyricist: Fern Lazicki}
{composer: Dale Wood}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 550}
{meta: tune LAUREL}
{meta: meter 12.9.9.9}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Every flow’r [G]that grows, [F#m]Every brook [Bm]that [D]flows,
[A/E]Tell of [D]beauty [F#m/A]God has [Bm]giv’n [F#m]for [G]me:
[A]Throughout mylifemay [F#m]beauty [D/A]be
[A7]Deep within [Bm]aheart [G]from sin [D/F#]set free.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Gracious Lord [Bm]above, [F#m]Looking down [Bm]in [D]love,
[A/E]Guide my thoughts, [D]my [Bm]life, [F#m/A]in my [Bm]walk [F#m]with [G]Thee,
[A]That [Bm]day [A/C#]by [D]day [G]the world [F#m]may [Em]see
[A7]Christ, the Lord [Bm]and Savior, [G]lives [D/F#]in me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]All my earthly [G]days, [F#m]I shall sing [Bm]and [D]praise
[A/E]God the Father, [Bm]Spirit, [F#m/A]and Christ [Bm]with [F#m]the [G]Son.
[A]Grant [Bm]faith [A/C#]when [D]life [G]on earth [F#m]is [Em]done,
[A7]I shall sing [Bm]with those [G]whose rest [D/F#]is won.
{end_of_verse}
